OL,5,G2305 999: Killer on the Line
OL,6,     FA panicked 911 call has police
OL,7,     Frushing to the scene to find an
OL,8,     Foccupant dead and guns abandoned
OL,9,     Foutside. An undercover Texas
OL,10,     FRanger operation uncovers a
OL,11,     Fshocking conspiracy.
OL,12,G0005 Inside the Bomb Squad: Zero Hour
OL,13,     FIn this gripping documentary
OL,14,     Fseries, we go on the frontline
OL,15,     Fwith the bomb disposal squads who
OL,16,     Fput their lives at risk to keep us
OL,17,     Fsafe, facing over 2,500 bomb
OL,18,     Femergencies each year.
